grammar emoji_palette
records entry comment blank_line
node palette group as palette context-level 1 context group_header
node subgroup group as subgroup context-level 2 context subgroup_header
node group_header group as header
node subgroup_header group as header
node group_name text as group_name trim
node subgroup_name text as subgroup_name trim
node entry group as entry
node codepoints text as sequence
node status text as status
node display text as display
node version text as version
node emoji_name text as name trim
node comment skip
node blank_line skip
